        "title": "Pivot: teks penting tersimpan dalam arsip Sysmon di MFT",
        "content": "File di Documents yang namanya tampak aneh memberi petunjuk: ROT13 mengubah vzcbegnag menjadi important dan vg'f fbzrjhere menjadi it's somewhere. Isi file .vibed sendiri berupa ciphertext Base64, jadi mendekode Base64 saja tidak memulihkan teks.\n\nPivot yang memecahkan Q10 adalah event penghapusan Sysmon. Event untuk vzcbegnag.txt mencatat MD5 9398192738C982338B3788C3E9F3583B dan SHA-256 3358740786A383367A9DFCCE80905556D9608CA1CBA870987F95B9F4DE508924. File arsip Sysmon bernama berdasarkan hash itu berada di direktori C:\\Sysmon. Record MFT 147927 memiliki data $DATA resident berisi:\n\n    hiCTF{finally_u_proved_ur_worthiness}\n\nHash teks tersebut cocok persis dengan hash pada event delete. Itu membuktikan isi record sebagai plaintext asli dan menjadi jawaban Q10; teks ini bukan flag akhir challenge.\n\nCara membaca atribut resident dari record MFT 1024-byte:\n\n    import struct\n    import hashlib\n    import os\n\n    def parse_record(mft, number):\n        mft.seek(number * 1024)\n        r = mft.read(1024)\n        if len(r) != 1024 or r[:4] != b'FILE':\n            return [], []\n        off = struct.unpack_from('<H', r, 20)[0]\n        names, data = [], []\n        while off + 8 <= 1024:\n            kind, size = struct.unpack_from('<II', r, off)\n            if kind == 0xffffffff or size < 8 or off + size > 1024:\n                break\n            nonresident = r[off + 8]\n            if not nonresident and kind in (0x30, 0x80):\n                value_size, value_off = struct.unpack_from('<IH', r, off + 16)\n                value = r[off + value_off:off + value_off + value_size]\n                if kind == 0x30 and len(value) >= 66:\n                    parent = struct.unpack_from('<Q', value, 0)[0] & 0x0000ffffffffffff\n                    n = value[64]\n                    name = value[66:66 + 2*n].decode('utf-16le', 'replace')\n                    names.append((parent, name))\n                elif kind == 0x80:\n                    data.append(value)\n            off += size\n        return names, data\n\n    # Sysmon archive files are children of MFT directory record 150815.\n    prefixes = ('9398192738C982338B3788C3E9F3583B',\n                '5029A640B0997C18AEB20DA3267EC240')\n    with open('C/$MFT', 'rb') as mft:\n        for number in range(os.path.getsize('C/$MFT') // 1024):\n            names, _ = parse_record(mft, number)\n            if any(parent == 150815 and name.upper().startswith(prefixes)\n                   for parent, name in names):\n                print('matching Sysmon archive record:', number, names)\n\n    with open('C/$MFT', 'rb') as mft:\n        for number in (147927, 147908):\n            names, streams = parse_record(mft, number)\n            print(number, names, streams)\n            for content in streams:\n                print('MD5', hashlib.md5(content).hexdigest().upper())\n                print('SHA256', hashlib.sha256(content).hexdigest().upper())\n\nRecord 147908 memberi plaintext bar.txt:\n\n    I will always be there for you bro!\n\nMD5 5029A640B0997C18AEB20DA3267EC240 dan SHA-256 AB80B467AFCF73B53561C784066E1B4DD6D6ECCE312248915BB995A4C62894E7 cocok dengan event delete untuk bar.txt. Dengan begitu plaintext Q13 terverifikasi independen dari nama arsip."
